      "comment": "A case for reed pens (<span lang=\"la\">calamī</span>); it serves for a pencil case."
    },
    {
      "latin": "capsa, capsae f.",
      "status": "alternative",
      "period": "classical",
      "gloss": "a box or case, above all for books; a satchel",
